  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 7201.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 7201.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to set forth the procedure for the registration of automated license plate readers used by law enforcement within the state, and the annual reporting requirements to the department.\n\nSource. #12648, eff 10-22-18",
